                <pb facs="0522" n="450" sameAs="frus:frus1909/pg450"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 4—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Vice Consul Caldera
                        to Mr. Lee Roy Cannon</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Managua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1909-11-15"><hi rendition="#italic">November 15,
                        1909</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I have appealed to the President in your behalf. I am awaiting his reply.</p>
                <closer><hi rendition="#small-caps">American Vice Consul.</hi></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
